   "forumId": "cms0o0eh80000uj0lmpkut6tc",
   "title": "Post guidelines",
   "content": "• **Post title** – Content title\nPost title must be the official English or native title of the content to be suggested\n\nUse proper tags:\n\n• **New series** – Series that are not available in Atsumaru. \nSearch before posting, toggle 18+ on if it's an adult series while searching.\n\n• **New source** – Series that already exist in Atsumaru but aren't up to date with released chapters/there are problems within the chapters.\n\n• **Tracker link** – Series link from [AniList](https://anilist.co/), [MyAnimeList](https://myanimelist.net/), [MangaBaka](https://mangabaka.org/)\nMangaBaka is preferred.\n\n• **Group or publisher link** – A group refers to a scanlation (translation) group, a publisher is the official company that finances, edits, serializes, and prints a manga.\n\nAggregator – A platform that hosts manga chapters from various sources all in one place.\n**DO NOT USE AGGREGATOR LINKS**\n\nManga – Japanese origin 🇯🇵\nManhwa – Korean origin 🇰🇷\nManhua – Chinese origin 🇨🇳\nComic – Original English Language series.\nNovel – Text-Based Format 🇦🇶",
